    (hφ : ∀ γ ∈ GQ B.A, ∀ g, φ (γ * g) = φ g) (hf : ∀ γ ∈ GQ B.V, ∀ g, f (γ * g) = f g) :
    besPer ψ 1 B.d B.o B.ζ μ 𝓕 ν 𝓝 φ f = B.per ψ φ f := by
